# Never commit archive bundles into this static-site repo.
# Avtzon.zip is a 189 MB image bundle that lives in the parent Downloads folder
# and repeatedly "sneaks into" storage/ during copy/build steps. GitHub rejects
# any file over 100 MB, so a single stray Avtzon.zip breaks the whole push.
# A published website never needs a .zip, so ignore them all as a safety net.
Avtzon.zip
*.zip

# OS / editor junk that has no place in the deploy
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini

# Local Netlify folder
.netlify

# Installed only to run `netlify dev` locally. Netlify installs from
# package.json on its own, so a committed tree would just go stale.
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# Local secrets for `netlify dev` (COMMENTS_ADMIN_KEY). The real one lives in
# the Netlify site environment and must never be in the repo.
.env
.env.*

# Python bytecode from the build scripts in tools/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
